dVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">The price is rather big, but I can’t remember a case when a perfect gaming accessory was sold for a penny.</p></div></li><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The keyboard is certainly premium, not cheap, and predictably well behaves in games.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/EhnyCcI-CL4/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">The keyboard is certainly premium, not cheap, and predictably well behaves in games.</p></div></li></ul></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoMoreButton__h9Vas\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Video review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__productAwardPagePadding__LFeX-\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__line__Z71fT\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaTitle__t55HQ\"><h2 class=\"pageMedia vnRogFont ProductAwardMedia__vnRogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(6)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hardware Info\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202009031816317420166.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      More interesting is the ROG Strix Scope TKL, which is available in both 'normal' and 'Deluxe' versions for around 150 euros.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Hardware Info\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>02/14/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe media of Hardware Info\" href=\".\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"4Gamers\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202008240955439910544.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ROG Strix Scope PBT 定價 NT$2890，Strix Scope TKL Deluxe 定價 NT$3490，兩者都各自有其強項，使用者可依喜好進行挑選。但筆者最期待 ROG 能推出雙色成形 PBT 透光鍵帽的鍵盤，畢竟 PBT 材質手感和耐磨損程度都遠勝於 ABS。\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      4Gamers\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>09/01/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe media of 4Gamers\" href=\"https://www.4gamers.com.tw/news/detail/44585/asus-rog-strix-scope-pbt-and-tkl-deluxe-review\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Microtron\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1261/202205091652439070934.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ASUS ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe - a great gaming mechanical keyboard for those who need compactness, minimalist design and no digital unit. If you play not only at home, but also attend e-sports championships - this model is just right! The keyboard in the backpack, the backpack on the shoulders and forward - for victories and unsurpassed feelings!\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Microtron\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>06/29/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe media of Microtron\" href=\"https://microtron.ua/news/asus-rog-strix-scope-tkl\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ITC Online\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202304182235298600342.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ASUS ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe is an excellent mechanical gaming keyboard for those who prefer compactness. Thanks to the minimalist design and the absence of a digital unit, it takes up a minimum of space on the table and fits into a backpack without any problems in case of “away” gaming sessions.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      ITC Online\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>03/03/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe media of ITC Online\" href=\"https://itc.ua/articles/obzor-igrovoj-mehanicheskoj-klaviatury-asus-rog-strix-scope-tkl-deluxe/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Root Nation\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202105181822545800091.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The mechanical (Cherry MX) ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe keyboard with RGB-RGB illumination is sharpened for shooters (the wide left Ctrl key), but is also perfect for long work with texts or office programs, thanks to a removable ergonomic wrist rest.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Root Nation\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>04/01/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe media of Root Nation\" href=\"https://root-nation.com/ru/pc/pc-monoblocks/ru-asus-universalnoe-mesto/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"GECID.com\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202009281943553300640.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The ASUS ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe keyboard offers an almost perfect set of features for gaming fans. It has a compact form factor, stylish design, excellent build quality, nice materials, sophisticated ergonomics, reliable and high-quality switches and LED lighting.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      GECID.com\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>06/12/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Scope TKL Deluxe media of GECID.com\" href=\"https://ua.gecid.com/periph/asus_rog_strix_scope_tkl_deluxe/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div> <script type=\"application/javascript\" src=\"https://rog.asus.com/rog/nuxtStatic/js/overview.js\"></script> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div> <!----> <!----></div></main>"}